msgid "Remote access"
msgstr "Zdalny dostęp"

msgid "rma_DESC_FTP_ACCESS"
msgstr " FTP Settings You can also control FTP access to your server. We recommend leaving this parameter set to 'no access' unless you have a specific reason to do otherwise.  Note: these settings limit access to the server and override other settings, including those for individual information bays. "

msgid "rma_DESC_FTP_LOGIN"
msgstr " You can also control authenticated FTP access to information bays and user accounts. We strongly recommend leaving this parameter set to private unless you have a specific reason to do otherwise.  Note: a secure shell sftp client can also be used to access the server, if remote access via the secure shell is enabled. This method of access protects the passwords and data of the FTP session, whereas standard FTP provides no protection. "

msgid "rma_DESC_IPSECRW"
msgstr " IPSEC Client (Roadwarrior) Settings You can allow IPSEC client access to your server, authenticated by digital certificates. You should leave this feature disabled by setting the value to the number 0 unless you require IPSEC client access. "

msgid "rma_DESC_IPSECRW_RESET"
msgstr "If you wish to reset all digital certificates, you can do so here.Any old certificates will no longer authenticate against the server, so all IPSEC clients will need to import a new certificate!. "

msgid "rma_DESC_PPTP"
msgstr " Ustawienia PPTP Możesz zezwolić na dostęp do sieci poprzez PPTP. Powinieneś zostawić wyłączoną usługę, poprzez ustawienie tej wielkości na 0, chyba że potrzebujesz dostępu poprzez PPTP. "

msgid "rma_DESC_SSH"
msgstr "  Secure Shell SettingsYou can control Secure Shell access to your server. The public setting should only be enabled by experienced administrators for remote problem diagnosis and resolution. We recommend leaving this parameter set to \"No Access\" unless you have a specific reason to do otherwise. "

msgid "rma_DESC_TELNET_ACCESS"
msgstr " Telnet Settings WARNING: Telnet is currently enabled, but this feature is no longer supported. Telnet is inherently insecure and should only be used in circumstances where no practical alternative exists. You should change option to %1 and use secure shell if remote access is required. Once disabled, telnet will no longer appear on this screen. "

msgid "rma_DESC_VALID_FROM_ENTRIES"
msgstr "Aby dodać nową zdalnie zarządzaną siecią, wpisz szczegóły sieci poniżej."

msgid "rma_ERROR_UPDATING_CONFIGURATION"
msgstr "(en) Error updating configuration"

msgid "rma_ERR_INVALID_PARAMS"
msgstr "(en)Either provide both a network and subnet mask, or leave both fields blank."

msgid "rma_FORM_TITLE"
msgstr "Zmień ustawienia dostępu zdalnego"

msgid "rma_INVALID_SUBNET_MASK"
msgstr "Nieprawidłowa maska podsieci"

